# |          |  Cp/Exe/param/files |            |         |                           |
# |          |  Chmod Qsub         |            |         |                           |
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# |    0     |       yes           |    yes     |  yes    |      yes                  |
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# |    1     |       yes           |    yes     |  yes    |      no                   |
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# |    2     |       yes           |    yes     |  no     |      no                   |
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# |    3     |       yes           |    no      |  no     |      no                   |
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
